@item sme-lutv2
Enable the SME Lookup Table v2 (LUTv2) extension.
@item cpa
Enable the Checked Pointer Arithmetic instructions.
@item sve-b16b16
Enable the SVE non-widening brain floating-point (@code{bf16}) extension.
