@item sve2p3
Enable SVE2.3.  This also enables SVE2.2 instructions.
@item sme2p3
Enable SME2.3.  This also enables SME2.2 instructions.
@item f16f32dot
Enable Armv9.7-a f16f32dot instructions.  This also enables Advanced SIMD,
