@item mtetc
Enable Data cache tag block operations.  This also enables Armv8.5-a Memory
Tagging Extensions.
@item f16f32mm
Enable Armv9.7-a f16f32mm instructions.  This also enables Advanced SIMD,
floating-point instructions and Armv8.2-a FP16 instructions.
@item f16mm
Enable f16mm instructions.  This also enables Advanced SIMD,
floating-point instructions and Armv8.2-a FP16 instructions.
